	'messages:rcfilters-watchlist-preference-help' => 'en:Loads [[{{#special:Watchlist}}|watchlist]] without filters search or highlighting functionality.',
	'messages:prefs-help-tokenmanagement' => 'en:You can see and reset the secret key for your account that can access the Web feed of your watchlist. Anyone who knows the key will be able to read your watchlist, so do not share it.',
	'messages:prefs-description-searchoptions' => 'en:Choose how autocomplete and results work.',
	'messages:searchlimit-label' => 'en:Number of search results to show on each page:',
	'messages:searchlimit-help' => 'en:Maximum number: $1',
	'messages:search-thumbnail-extra-namespaces-label' => 'en:Show thumbnails in Special:Search on Desktop',
	'messages:search-thumbnail-extra-namespaces-message' => 'en:Displays thumbnails for $1 {{PLURAL:$2|namespace|namespaces}} results on the {{#special:search}} page',
	'messages:apihelp-main-summary' => 'en:',
	'messages:apihelp-main-extended-description' => 'en:<div class="hlist plainlinks api-main-links">
* [[mw:Special:MyLanguage/API:Main_page|Documentation]]
* [[mw:Special:MyLanguage/API:Etiquette|Etiquette & usage guidelines]]
* [[mw:Special:MyLanguage/API:FAQ|FAQ]]
* [https://lists.wikimedia.org/postorius/lists/mediawiki-api.lists.wikimedia.org/ Mailing list]
* [https://lists.wikimedia.org/postorius/lists/mediawiki-api-announce.lists.wikimedia.org/ API Announcements]
* [https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/maniphest/query/GebfyV4uCaLd/#R Bugs & requests]
</div>
<strong>Status:</strong> The MediaWiki API is a mature and stable interface that is actively supported and improved. While we try to avoid it, we may occasionally need to make breaking changes; subscribe to [https://lists.wikimedia.org/hyperkitty/list/mediawiki-api-announce@lists.wikimedia.org/ the mediawiki-api-announce mailing list] for notice of updates.

<strong>Erroneous requests:</strong> When erroneous requests are sent to the API, an HTTP header will be sent with the key "MediaWiki-API-Error" and then both the value of the header and the error code sent back will be set to the same value. For more information see [[mw:Special:MyLanguage/API:Errors_and_warnings|API: Errors and warnings]].

<p class="mw-apisandbox-link"><strong>Testing:</strong> For ease of testing API requests, see [[Special:ApiSandbox]].</p>',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-maxlag' => 'en:Maximum lag can be used when MediaWiki is installed on a database replicated cluster. To save actions causing any more site replication lag, this parameter can make the client wait until the replication lag is less than the specified value. In case of excessive lag, error code <samp>maxlag</samp> is returned with a message like <samp>Waiting for $host: $lag seconds lagged</samp>.<br />See [[mw:Special:MyLanguage/Manual:Maxlag_parameter|Manual: Maxlag parameter]] for more information.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-smaxage' => 'en:Set the <code>s-maxage</code> HTTP cache control header to this many seconds. Errors are never cached.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-maxage' => 'en:Set the <code>max-age</code> HTTP cache control header to this many seconds. Errors are never cached.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-assert' => 'en:Verify that the user is logged in (including possibly as a temporary user) if set to <kbd>user</kbd>, <em>not</em> logged in if set to <kbd>anon</kbd>, or has the bot user right if <kbd>bot</kbd>.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-assertuser' => 'en:Verify the current user is the named user.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-servedby' => 'en:Include the hostname that served the request in the results.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-curtimestamp' => 'en:Include the current timestamp in the result.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-responselanginfo' => 'en:Include the languages used for <var>uselang</var> and <var>errorlang</var> in the result.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-origin' => 'en:When accessing the API using a cross-domain AJAX request (CORS), set this to the originating domain. This must be included in any pre-flight request, and therefore must be part of the request URI (not the POST body).

For authenticated requests, this must match one of the origins in the <code>Origin</code> header exactly, so it has to be set to something like <kbd>https://en.wikipedia.org</kbd> or <kbd>https://meta.wikimedia.org</kbd>. If this parameter does not match the <code>Origin</code> header, a 403 response will be returned. If this parameter matches the <code>Origin</code> header and the origin is allowed, the <code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code> and <code>Access-Control-Allow-Credentials</code> headers will be set.

For non-authenticated requests, specify the value <kbd>*</kbd>. This will cause the <code>Access-Control-Allow-Origin</code> header to be set, but <code>Access-Control-Allow-Credentials</code> will be <code>false</code> and all user-specific data will be restricted.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-crossorigin' => 'en:When accessing the API using a cross-domain AJAX request (CORS) and using a session provider that is safe against cross-site request forgery (CSRF) attacks (such as OAuth), use this instead of <code>origin=*</code> to make the request authenticated (i.e., not logged out). This must be included in any pre-flight request, and therefore must be part of the request URI (not the POST body).

Note that most session providers, including standard cookie-based sessions, do not support authenticated CORS and cannot be used with this parameter.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-uselang' => 'en:Language to use for message translations. <kbd>[[Special:ApiHelp/query+siteinfo|action=query&meta=siteinfo&siprop=languages]]</kbd> returns a list of language codes. You can specify <kbd>user</kbd> to use the current user\'s language preference or <kbd>content</kbd> to use this wiki\'s content language.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-variant' => 'en:Variant of the language. Only works if the base language supports variant conversion.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-errorformat' => 'en:Format to use for warning and error text output',
	'messages:apihelp-main-paramvalue-errorformat-plaintext' => 'en:Wikitext with HTML tags removed and entities replaced.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-paramvalue-errorformat-wikitext' => 'en:Unparsed wikitext.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-paramvalue-errorformat-html' => 'en:HTML',
	'messages:apihelp-main-paramvalue-errorformat-raw' => 'en:Message key and parameters.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-paramvalue-errorformat-none' => 'en:No text output, only the error codes.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-paramvalue-errorformat-bc' => 'en:Format used prior to MediaWiki 1.29. <var>errorlang</var> and <var>errorsuselocal</var> are ignored.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-errorlang' => 'en:Language to use for warnings and errors. <kbd>[[Special:ApiHelp/query+siteinfo|action=query&meta=siteinfo&siprop=languages]]</kbd> returns a list of language codes. Specify <kbd>content</kbd> to use this wiki\'s content language or <kbd>uselang</kbd> to use the same value as the <var>uselang</var> parameter.',
	'messages:apihelp-main-param-errorsuselocal' => 'en:If given, error texts will use locally-customized messages from the {{ns:MediaWiki}} namespace.',
	'messages:apihelp-acquiretempusername-summary' => 'en:Acquire a temporary user username and stash it in the current session, if temp account creation is enabled and the current user is logged out. If a name has already been stashed, returns the same name.',
	'messages:apihelp-acquiretempusername-extended-description' => 'en:If the user later performs an action that results in temp account creation, the stashed username will be used for their account. It may also be used in previews. However, the account is not created yet, and the name is not visible to other users.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-summary' => 'en:Block a user.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-id' => 'en:The block ID to modify.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-user' => 'en:User to block.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-userid' => 'en:Specify <kbd>$1user=#<var>ID</var></kbd> instead.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-expiry' => 'en:Expiry time. May be relative (e.g. <kbd>5 months</kbd> or <kbd>2 weeks</kbd>) or absolute (e.g. <kbd>2014-09-18T12:34:56Z</kbd>). If set to <kbd>infinite</kbd>, <kbd>indefinite</kbd>, or <kbd>never</kbd>, the block will never expire.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-anononly' => 'en:Block anonymous users only (i.e. disable anonymous edits for this IP address, including temporary account edits).',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-hidename' => 'en:Hide the username from the block log. (Requires the <code>hideuser</code> right).',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-allowusertalk' => 'en:Allow the user to edit their own talk page (depends on <var>[[mw:Special:MyLanguage/Manual:$wgBlockAllowsUTEdit|$wgBlockAllowsUTEdit]]</var>).',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-reblock' => 'en:If the user is already blocked by a single block, overwrite the existing block. If the user is blocked more than once, this will fail—use the <var>id</var> parameter instead to specify which block to overwrite.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-newblock' => 'en:Add another block even if the user is already blocked.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-watchuser' => 'en:Watch the user\'s or IP address\'s user and talk pages.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-watchlistexpiry' => 'en:Watchlist expiry timestamp. Omit this parameter entirely to leave the current expiry unchanged.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-tags' => 'en:Change tags to apply to the entry in the block log.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-partial' => 'en:Block user from specific pages or namespaces rather than the entire site.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-pagerestrictions' => 'en:List of titles to block the user from editing. Only applies when <var>partial</var> is set to true.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-namespacerestrictions' => 'en:List of namespace IDs to block the user from editing. Only applies when <var>partial</var> is set to true.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-param-actionrestrictions' => 'en:List of actions to block the user from performing. Only applies when <var>partial</var> is set to true.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-example-ip-simple' => 'en:Block IP address <kbd>192.0.2.5</kbd> for three days with a reason.',
	'messages:apihelp-block-example-user-complex' => 'en:Block user <kbd>Vandal</kbd> indefinitely with a reason, and prevent new account creation and email sending.',
	'messages:apihelp-changeauthenticationdata-summary' => 'en:Change authentication data for the current user.',
	'messages:apihelp-changeauthenticationdata-example-password' => 'en:Attempt to change the current user\'s password to <kbd>ExamplePassword</kbd>.',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-summary' => 'en:Change the content model of a page',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-param-title' => 'en:Title of the page to change the contentmodel of. Cannot be used together with <var>$1pageid</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-param-pageid' => 'en:Page ID of the page to change the contentmodel of. Cannot be used together with <var>$1title</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-param-summary' => 'en:Edit summary and log entry reason',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-param-tags' => 'en:Change tags to apply to the log entry and edit.',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-param-model' => 'en:Content model of the new content.',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-param-bot' => 'en:Mark the content model change with a bot flag.',
	'messages:apihelp-changecontentmodel-example' => 'en:Change the main page to have the <code>text</code> content model',
	'messages:apihelp-checktoken-summary' => 'en:Check the validity of a token from <kbd>[[Special:ApiHelp/query+tokens|action=query&meta=tokens]]</kbd>.',
	'messages:apihelp-checktoken-param-type' => 'en:Type of token being tested.',
	'messages:apihelp-checktoken-param-maxtokenage' => 'en:Maximum allowed age of the token, in seconds.',
	'messages:apihelp-checktoken-example-simple' => 'en:Test the validity of a <kbd>csrf</kbd> token.',
	'messages:apihelp-clearhasmsg-summary' => 'en:Clears the <code>hasmsg</code> flag for the current user.',
	'messages:apihelp-clearhasmsg-example-1' => 'en:Clear the <code>hasmsg</code> flag for the current user.',
	'messages:apihelp-clientlogin-summary' => 'en:Log in to the wiki using the interactive flow.',
	'messages:apihelp-clientlogin-example-login' => 'en:Start the process of logging in to the wiki as user <kbd>Example</kbd> with password <kbd>ExamplePassword</kbd>.',
	'messages:apihelp-clientlogin-example-login2' => 'en:Continue logging in after a <samp>UI</samp> response for two-factor auth, supplying an <var>OATHToken</var> of <kbd>987654</kbd>.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-summary' => 'en:Get the difference between two pages.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-extended-description' => 'en:A revision number, a page title, a page ID, text, or a relative reference for both "from" and "to" must be passed.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromtitle' => 'en:First title to compare.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromid' => 'en:First page ID to compare.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromrev' => 'en:First revision to compare.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-frompst' => 'en:Do a pre-save transform on <var>fromtext-&#x7B;slot}</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromslots' => 'en:Override content of the revision specified by <var>fromtitle</var>, <var>fromid</var> or <var>fromrev</var>.

This parameter specifies the slots that are to be modified. Use <var>fromtext-&#x7B;slot}</var>, <var>fromcontentmodel-&#x7B;slot}</var>, and <var>fromcontentformat-&#x7B;slot}</var> to specify content for each slot.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromtext-{slot}' => 'en:Text of the specified slot. If omitted, the slot is removed from the revision.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromsection-{slot}' => 'en:When <var>fromtext-&#x7B;slot}</var> is the content of a single section, this is the section identifier. It will be merged into the revision specified by <var>fromtitle</var>, <var>fromid</var> or <var>fromrev</var> as if for a section edit.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromcontentmodel-{slot}' => 'en:Content model of <var>fromtext-&#x7B;slot}</var>. If not supplied, it will be guessed based on the other parameters.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromcontentformat-{slot}' => 'en:Content serialization format of <var>fromtext-&#x7B;slot}</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromtext' => 'en:Specify <kbd>fromslots=main</kbd> and use <var>fromtext-main</var> instead.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromcontentmodel' => 'en:Specify <kbd>fromslots=main</kbd> and use <var>fromcontentmodel-main</var> instead.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromcontentformat' => 'en:Specify <kbd>fromslots=main</kbd> and use <var>fromcontentformat-main</var> instead.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-fromsection' => 'en:Only use the specified section of the specified \'from\' content.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-totitle' => 'en:Second title to compare.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-toid' => 'en:Second page ID to compare.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-torev' => 'en:Second revision to compare.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-torelative' => 'en:Use a revision relative to the revision determined from <var>fromtitle</var>, <var>fromid</var> or <var>fromrev</var>. All of the other \'to\' options will be ignored.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-topst' => 'en:Do a pre-save transform on <var>totext</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-toslots' => 'en:Override content of the revision specified by <var>totitle</var>, <var>toid</var> or <var>torev</var>.

This parameter specifies the slots that are to be modified. Use <var>totext-&#x7B;slot}</var>, <var>tocontentmodel-&#x7B;slot}</var>, and <var>tocontentformat-&#x7B;slot}</var> to specify content for each slot.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-totext-{slot}' => 'en:Text of the specified slot. If omitted, the slot is removed from the revision.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-tosection-{slot}' => 'en:When <var>totext-&#x7B;slot}</var> is the content of a single section, this is the section identifier. It will be merged into the revision specified by <var>totitle</var>, <var>toid</var> or <var>torev</var> as if for a section edit.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-tocontentmodel-{slot}' => 'en:Content model of <var>totext-&#x7B;slot}</var>. If not supplied, it will be guessed based on the other parameters.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-tocontentformat-{slot}' => 'en:Content serialization format of <var>totext-&#x7B;slot}</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-totext' => 'en:Specify <kbd>toslots=main</kbd> and use <var>totext-main</var> instead.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-tocontentmodel' => 'en:Specify <kbd>toslots=main</kbd> and use <var>tocontentmodel-main</var> instead.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-tocontentformat' => 'en:Specify <kbd>toslots=main</kbd> and use <var>tocontentformat-main</var> instead.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-tosection' => 'en:Only use the specified section of the specified \'to\' content.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-prop' => 'en:Which pieces of information to get.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-diff' => 'en:The diff HTML.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-diffsize' => 'en:The size of the diff HTML, in bytes.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-rel' => 'en:The revision IDs of the revision previous to \'from\' and after \'to\', if any.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-ids' => 'en:The page and revision IDs of the \'from\' and \'to\' revisions.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-title' => 'en:The page titles of the \'from\' and \'to\' revisions.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-user' => 'en:The username and ID of the \'from\' and \'to\' revisions. If the user has been revision deleted, a <samp>fromuserhidden</samp> or <samp>touserhidden</samp> property will be returned.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-comment' => 'en:The comment on the \'from\' and \'to\' revisions. If the comment has been revision deleted, a <samp>fromcommenthidden</samp> or <samp>tocommenthidden</samp> property will be returned.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-parsedcomment' => 'en:The parsed comment on the \'from\' and \'to\' revisions. If the comment has been revision deleted, a <samp>fromcommenthidden</samp> or <samp>tocommenthidden</samp> property will be returned.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-size' => 'en:The size of the \'from\' and \'to\' revisions.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-paramvalue-prop-timestamp' => 'en:The timestamp of the \'from\' and \'to\' revisions.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-difftype' => 'en:Return the comparison formatted as inline HTML.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-param-slots' => 'en:Return individual diffs for these slots, rather than one combined diff for all slots.',
	'messages:apihelp-compare-example-1' => 'en:Create a diff between revision 1 and 2.',
	'messages:apihelp-createaccount-param-preservestate' => 'en:If <kbd>[[Special:ApiHelp/query+authmanagerinfo|action=query&meta=authmanagerinfo]]</kbd> returned true for <samp>hasprimarypreservedstate</samp>, requests marked as <samp>primary-required</samp> should be omitted. If it returned a non-empty value for <samp>preservedusername</samp>, that username must be used for the <var>username</var> parameter.',
	'messages:apihelp-createaccount-example-create' => 'en:Start the process of creating the user <kbd>Example</kbd> with the password <kbd>ExamplePassword</kbd>.',
	'messages:apihelp-cspreport-summary' => 'en:Used by browsers to report violations of the Content Security Policy. This module should never be used, except when used automatically by a CSP compliant web browser.',
	'messages:apihelp-cspreport-param-reportonly' => 'en:Mark as being a report from a monitoring policy, not an enforced policy',
	'messages:apihelp-cspreport-param-source' => 'en:What generated the CSP header that triggered this report',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-title' => 'en:Title of the page to delete. Cannot be used together with <var>$1pageid</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-pageid' => 'en:Page ID of the page to delete. Cannot be used together with <var>$1title</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-reason' => 'en:Reason for the deletion. If not set, an automatically generated reason will be used.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-tags' => 'en:Change tags to apply to the entry in the deletion log.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-deletetalk' => 'en:Delete the talk page, if it exists.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-watch' => 'en:Add the page to the current user\'s watchlist.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-watchlist' => 'en:Unconditionally add or remove the page from the current user\'s watchlist, use preferences (ignored for bot users) or do not change watch.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-watchlistexpiry' => 'en:Watchlist expiry timestamp. Omit this parameter entirely to leave the current expiry unchanged.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-unwatch' => 'en:Remove the page from the current user\'s watchlist.',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-param-oldimage' => 'en:The name of the old image to delete as provided by [[Special:ApiHelp/query+imageinfo|action=query&prop=imageinfo&iiprop=archivename]].',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-example-simple' => 'en:Delete [[{{MediaWiki:Mainpage}}]].',
	'messages:apihelp-delete-example-reason' => 'en:Delete [[{{MediaWiki:Mainpage}}]] with the reason <kbd>Preparing for move</kbd>.',
	'messages:apihelp-disabled-summary' => 'en:This module has been disabled.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-title' => 'en:Title of the page to edit. Cannot be used together with <var>$1pageid</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-pageid' => 'en:Page ID of the page to edit. Cannot be used together with <var>$1title</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-section' => 'en:Section identifier. <kbd>0</kbd> for the top section, <kbd>new</kbd> for a new section. Often a positive integer, but can also be non-numeric.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-summary' => 'en:Edit summary.

When this parameter is not provided or empty, [[mw:Special:MyLanguage/Autosummary|an edit summary may be generated automatically]].

When using <var>$1section=new</var> and <var>$1sectiontitle</var> is not provided, the value of this parameter is used for the section title instead, and an edit summary is generated automatically.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-tags' => 'en:Change tags to apply to the revision.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-baserevid' => 'en:ID of the base revision, used to detect edit conflicts. May be obtained through [[Special:ApiHelp/query+revisions|action=query&prop=revisions]]. Self-conflicts cause the edit to fail unless basetimestamp is set.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-basetimestamp' => 'en:Timestamp of the base revision, used to detect edit conflicts. May be obtained through [[Special:ApiHelp/query+revisions|action=query&prop=revisions&rvprop=timestamp]]. Self-conflicts are ignored.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-starttimestamp' => 'en:Timestamp when the editing process began, used to detect edit conflicts. An appropriate value may be obtained using <var>[[Special:ApiHelp/main|curtimestamp]]</var> when beginning the edit process (e.g. when loading the page content to edit).',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-recreate' => 'en:Override any errors about the page having been deleted in the meantime.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-watchlist' => 'en:Unconditionally add or remove the page from the current user\'s watchlist, use preferences (ignored for bot users) or do not change watch.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-watchlistexpiry' => 'en:Watchlist expiry timestamp. Omit this parameter entirely to leave the current expiry unchanged.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-md5' => 'en:The MD5 hash of the $1text parameter, or the $1prependtext and $1appendtext parameters concatenated. If set, the edit won\'t be done unless the hash is correct.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-prependtext' => 'en:Add this text to the beginning of the page or section. Overrides $1text.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-appendtext' => 'en:Add this text to the end of the page or section. Overrides $1text.

Use $1section=new to append a new section, rather than this parameter.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-undo' => 'en:Undo this revision. Overrides $1text, $1prependtext and $1appendtext.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-undoafter' => 'en:Undo all revisions from $1undo to this one. If not set, just undo one revision.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-redirect' => 'en:Automatically resolve redirects.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-contentformat' => 'en:Content serialization format used for the input text.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-contentmodel' => 'en:Content model of the new content.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-returnto' => 'en:Page title. If saving the edit created a temporary account, the API may respond with an URL that the client should visit to complete logging in. If this parameter is provided, the URL will redirect to the given page, instead of the page that was edited.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-returntoquery' => 'en:URL query parameters (with leading <kbd>?</kbd>). If saving the edit created a temporary account, the API may respond with an URL that the client should visit to complete logging in. If this parameter is provided, the URL will redirect to a page with the given query parameters.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-returntoanchor' => 'en:URL fragment (with leading <kbd>#</kbd>). If saving the edit created a temporary account, the API may respond with an URL that the client should visit to complete logging in. If this parameter is provided, the URL will redirect to a page with the given fragment.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-param-token' => 'en:The token should always be sent as the last parameter, or at least after the $1text parameter.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-example-prepend' => 'en:Prepend <kbd>_&#95;NOTOC_&#95;</kbd> to a page.',
	'messages:apihelp-edit-example-undo' => 'en:Undo revisions 13579 through 13585 with autosummary.',
	'messages:apihelp-emailuser-param-target' => 'en:User to send the email to.',
	'messages:apihelp-emailuser-param-subject' => 'en:Subject header.',
